OL,3,GNEWSACrime-tackling hub opens at
OL,4,Atransport interchange
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hub aimed at tackling anti-social
OL,7,Fbehaviour has officially opened at a
OL,8,Fbusy transport interchange.
OL,10,FThe South Tyneside engagement and
OL,11,Fpartnership (STEP) team - comprised of
OL,12,FNorthumbria Police, South Tyneside
OL,13,FCouncil and Nexus staff - is based at
OL,14,FSouth Shields interchange.
OL,16,FThe team said it was created in
OL,17,Fresponse to concerns about anti-social
OL,18,Fbehaviour and crime in and around the
OL,19,Finterchange, and hoped the increased
OL,20,Fvisibility would act as a deterrent.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
